@startuml
title Hole Elaboration: Fill and Capture
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

rectangle "FLT template\nperl{ print(${x}) }" as Template #FEF3C7
rectangle "Construction context\nfill ${x} from environment" as Fill #DBEAFE
rectangle "Pattern context\ncapture ${x} from match" as Capture #EDE9FE
rectangle "Bound AST value\nnot source text" as Bound #DCFCE7
rectangle "Captured AST value\navailable to guards" as Matched #DCFCE7

Template --> Fill : term position
Template --> Capture : pattern position
Fill --> Bound : AST graft
Capture --> Matched : typed subtree binding

legend right
  |= Color |= Concept |
  |<#FEF3C7> | FLT template |
  |<#DBEAFE> | Construction-side fill |
  |<#EDE9FE> | Pattern-side capture |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Typed AST values |
endlegend
@enduml
